// A rule variable that only the rule's `_restrict` formula mentions.
//
// `liftedAddProtoRule` (Theory/Text/Parser.hs) leaves the `_restrict`
// formula in the rule's `_preRestriction` field (Theory/Model/Rule.hs) and
// adds the action fact `fromRuleRestriction` builds
// (Theory/Model/Restriction.hs).  That fact carries the formula's free
// variables minus `varNow` (Theory/Model/Restriction.hs), so
// `#NOW` is the one variable a `_restrict` can introduce that reaches no fact
// of the rule.
//
// `ruleSortsReport` (Theory/Tools/Wellformedness.hs) folds the whole
// rule through `frees`; `HasFrees (Rule i)` folds the rule info first
// (Theory/Model/Rule.hs) and `HasFrees ProtoRuleEInfo`
// (Theory/Model/Rule.hs) folds the restrictions inside it.  `~now` and
// `#NOW` share a lowercased name and an index and differ in sort, so
// `sortsClashCheck` (Theory/Tools/Wellformedness.hs) groups them.
//
// Mode `match`: the two engines agree on this shape.
//
// Compared slice: the wf report block.


theory S8RestrictSortClash
begin

rule R:
  [ Fr(~now) ]
  --[ _restrict( Ex #j. A() @ #j & #j < #NOW ) ]->
  [ Out(~now) ]

end
